+    // resolves what to give (it reads player->getItemEntry); setting that here to the item's real GetItemEntry
+    // makes the chest's own get-item flow show + give it — one acquisition animation, the chest opens normally,
+    // no "empty chest crushes Link", no placeholder-then-item double give. The chest still carries a valid
+    // placeholder GetItem id in its params so the open path triggers (getItemId != GI_NONE); the owned flags
+    // (hasFierceDeityMask / Roc's RAND_INF+slot) are ensured by MhChestInterpreter once the get finishes.
